OL,3,GNEWSABereaved dad condemns throwline
OL,4,Avandalism
OL,5,
OL,6,FA dad whose son drowned has slammed
OL,7,F"mindless vandalism" after three
OL,8,Fthrowline boards were damaged.
OL,10,FTyne and Wear Fire and Rescue Service
OL,11,F(TWFRS) said over the past nine months
OL,12,Fboards at three Newcastle parks have
OL,13,Fbeen targeted, including one just
OL,14,Frecently at Jesmond Vale.
OL,16,FNick Pope, from Ponteland, in
OL,17,FNorthumberland, has been campaigning
OL,18,Ffor more safety measures to be
OL,19,Finstalled around the region since his
OL,20,Fson, Charlie, 19, drowned in
OL,21,FManchester's Rochdale Canal during a
OL,22,Fnight out in 2018.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,395,390,260,160,0,100
