OL,3,GNEWSABereaved dad condemns throwline
OL,4,Avandalism
OL,5,
OL,6,F"There's been fantastic work done to
OL,7,Fget them there in the first place, it's
OL,8,Fproven they've saved lives and to
OL,9,Fvandalise something like that just
OL,10,Fbeggars belief really," Pope said.
